                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It seemed interesting at first. I thought I was playing it wrong or had a broken interface, because I was zipping through space with absolutely nothing appearing except the occasional  asteroid I had to dodge, yet my map showed no objects I could travel to save one that (I think) was a derelict ship I was supposed to pull salvage from. \n\nHowever, upon reading the reviews, i appears this is intentional. I MUST stare at the screen to dodge the occasional asteroid and wait 15-20 minutes of real time travel between objects of interest.\n\nI don't want to do that. And it's a shame, because I think a change to this mechanic would probably reveal an interesting game.",
